.* QUIDSPBNDD: DSPBNDDIR, a binding directory's entries in order.
.* CRTHEAD is the creation group's heading, dashed to its width.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=HEADCL BASETYPE='CHAR 23'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TIMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 8'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=BNDDIR CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=BNDLIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=CRTHEAD CLASS=HEADCL.
:VAR NAME=ENTOBJ CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=ENTTYPE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=ENTLIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=ENTACT CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=ENTDATE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=ENTTIME CLASS=TIMECL.
:LISTDEF NAME=ENTS VARS='ENTOBJ ENTTYPE ENTLIB ENTACT ENTDATE ENTTIME'.
:KEYL NAME=KEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F10 ACTION=TOP.F10=Refresh to top
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F17 ACTION=TOP.F17=Top
:KEYI KEY=F18 ACTION=BOTTOM.F18=Bottom
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPBNDDIR KEYL=KEYS HELP=DSPBNDDH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SPACE BOTSEP=NONE.Display Binding Directory
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI VAR=BNDDIR USAGE=OUTPUT.Binding Directory
:DATAIX VAR=BNDLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Library
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=ENTS SCROLL=YES.(No entries in the binding directory)
:LISTCOL VAR=ENTOBJ USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=11.Object
:LISTCOL VAR=ENTTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=11.Type
:LISTCOL VAR=ENTLIB USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=11.Library
:LISTCOL VAR=ENTACT USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=11.Activation
:LISTGRP.&CRTHEAD.
:LISTCOL VAR=ENTDATE USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=11.Date
:LISTCOL VAR=ENTTIME USAGE=OUTPUT.Time
:ELISTGRP.
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=DSPBNDDH.Display Binding Directory - Help
:P.The modules and service programs the binder looks in, in the order
it looks, with how each service program is activated and when the
entry was added.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=KEYSHLP.Function keys - Help
:P.F3 leaves the display, F12 goes back one display, F10 and F17 go to
the first entry and F18 to the last.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
